    {
      "id": "c1",
      "by": "marcus",
      "text": "Whole web pages need a 3.5-inch screen. Add a keyboard and the phone is too big for a pocket.",
      "x": 3352,
      "y": 240,
      "kind": "comment",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "c1-r1",
